1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:01:33,930
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

2
00:01:35,625 --> 00:01:38,705
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:39,505 --> 00:01:41,625
10 MONTHS LATER

4
00:01:47,065 --> 00:01:48,265
Shang Zhitao.

5
00:01:48,345 --> 00:01:50,105
You haven't contacted me
for almost a week.

6
00:01:50,665 --> 00:01:52,865
I told you

7
00:01:52,945 --> 00:01:55,585
that I was conducting a study
in the Gobi Desert with the project team.

8
00:01:55,665 --> 00:01:57,545
The signal over there was bad.

9
00:01:57,625 --> 00:01:59,305
Aren't you going to the US
to report your work?

10
00:01:59,385 --> 00:02:00,905
You haven't left yet?

11
00:02:00,985 --> 00:02:02,225
You're so heartless.

12
00:02:03,025 --> 00:02:05,225
Do you think I can leave
without making sure you're fine?

13
00:02:08,905 --> 00:02:10,905
It's still a long-distance relationship.
Where I'm at makes no difference.

14
00:02:10,985 --> 00:02:12,705
The US and Beijing are the same.

15
00:02:15,705 --> 00:02:16,585
Luan Nian.

16
00:02:17,985 --> 00:02:20,265
I wish you success in your report.

17
00:02:22,665 --> 00:02:23,905
When I'm back home,

18
00:02:23,985 --> 00:02:25,025
let's have a video call.

19
00:02:25,105 --> 00:02:26,025
I want to see Luke.

20
00:02:27,505 --> 00:02:28,385
Say it again.

21
00:02:28,465 --> 00:02:30,225
You just want to see Luke?

22
00:02:30,865 --> 00:02:31,985
Of course.

23
00:02:32,065 --> 00:02:33,665
That's my dog.

24
00:02:34,265 --> 00:02:35,545
Say it again.

25
00:02:35,625 --> 00:02:36,625
Whose dog?

26
00:02:37,305 --> 00:02:38,305
Our dog.

27
00:02:44,905 --> 00:02:46,585
Let's leave it here. I'll arrive soon.

28
00:02:57,025 --> 00:02:59,345
I WILL WATCH OVER YOU FROM BEYOND
THIS WORLD, UNTIL YOUR LIFE IS WHOLE

29
00:03:10,265 --> 00:03:11,745
-Thank you.
-Okay.

30
00:03:11,825 --> 00:03:12,785
Tao.

31
00:03:15,505 --> 00:03:16,745
Why are you here?

32
00:03:19,105 --> 00:03:21,185
My assignment in Northwestern China
is ending.

33
00:03:22,425 --> 00:03:24,425
I wanted to see you before I leave.

34
00:03:25,185 --> 00:03:26,945
Why didn't you send me a text?

35
00:03:27,025 --> 00:03:29,065
What if you didn't see me?
I just came back from a business trip.

36
00:03:30,025 --> 00:03:32,345
Come up. Let's have a drink.

37
00:03:32,425 --> 00:03:34,905
It's fine. It's quite late.

38
00:03:34,985 --> 00:03:36,225
I have to hurry and catch the last bus.

39
00:03:38,705 --> 00:03:39,625
This is for you.

40
00:03:40,265 --> 00:03:41,465
I got it from the mountains.

41
00:03:42,065 --> 00:03:43,025
I think you might like it.

42
00:03:48,145 --> 00:03:49,905
There was a year

43
00:03:49,985 --> 00:03:53,705
when I received flowers
every day for a week at work.

44
00:03:53,785 --> 00:03:55,145
Was that you?

45
00:03:58,385 --> 00:04:01,065
Back then, you said
you wanted flowers so much,

46
00:04:01,145 --> 00:04:02,545
but if it was prepared beforehand,

47
00:04:02,625 --> 00:04:04,185
it wouldn't be surprising.

48
00:04:04,265 --> 00:04:06,585
So, I sent them for a few days as a prank.

49
00:04:08,705 --> 00:04:10,505
I hope you liked them back then.

50
00:04:11,545 --> 00:04:12,505
Thanks, Zhu.

51
00:04:12,585 --> 00:04:13,945
I liked them a lot.

52
00:04:14,025 --> 00:04:15,745
Oh, my work here is done

53
00:04:15,825 --> 00:04:16,665
after a month.

54
00:04:16,745 --> 00:04:17,745
When I return to Beijing,

55
00:04:17,825 --> 00:04:18,865
let's go watch a movie, okay?

56
00:04:18,944 --> 00:04:19,785
Midnight screening.

57
00:04:19,865 --> 00:04:20,905
We'll go every weekend.

58
00:04:20,985 --> 00:04:23,025
Let's watch all the old movies together.

59
00:04:23,105 --> 00:04:24,345
We'll call Sun Yu too.

60
00:04:25,465 --> 00:04:26,305
Sure.

61
00:04:26,945 --> 00:04:28,105
I'll buy the tickets.

62
00:04:28,705 --> 00:04:30,185
No. Let Sun Yu buy them.

63
00:04:30,865 --> 00:04:32,665
Her team is doing very well now.

64
00:04:32,745 --> 00:04:34,185
You haven't seen each other for so long.

65
00:04:34,265 --> 00:04:37,065
If Sun Yu knows that you're going back,
she will be so happy.

66
00:04:37,145 --> 00:04:38,985
-Let me tell Sun Yu.
-Don't.

67
00:04:40,505 --> 00:04:41,945
Don't disturb her.

68
00:04:45,465 --> 00:04:46,665
Before you

69
00:04:47,265 --> 00:04:50,065
return to Beijing, do you need
to go back to your hometown?

70
00:04:50,145 --> 00:04:51,505
How's your mother?

71
00:04:51,585 --> 00:04:52,705
Is she doing well?

72
00:04:59,505 --> 00:05:00,345
She passed away.

73
00:05:06,105 --> 00:05:08,065
When did that happen?

74
00:05:11,585 --> 00:05:13,105
During the Chinese New Year.

75
00:05:15,225 --> 00:05:16,065
You…

76
00:05:17,265 --> 00:05:18,665
Why didn't you tell us?

77
00:05:21,785 --> 00:05:24,705
That was the time when all of you
were reunited with your family members.

78
00:05:28,785 --> 00:05:30,305
I didn't want all of you to be sad.

79
00:05:41,345 --> 00:05:42,185
What about your younger sister?

80
00:05:43,705 --> 00:05:44,585
Is she well?

81
00:05:45,865 --> 00:05:47,385
She is studying well.

82
00:05:50,145 --> 00:05:51,025
What about your father?

83
00:05:53,065 --> 00:05:53,945
He's doing well too.

84
00:05:57,305 --> 00:05:58,185
What about you?

85
00:05:59,745 --> 00:06:01,105
Are you well, Sun Yuanzhu?

86
00:06:06,465 --> 00:06:07,505
I'm well.

87
00:06:13,345 --> 00:06:14,385
That's good enough.

88
00:06:19,665 --> 00:06:20,825
Let me take you to the bus stop.

89
00:06:20,905 --> 00:06:21,985
I'll drop off my luggage.

90
00:06:22,065 --> 00:06:22,905
Wait for me.

91
00:06:25,265 --> 00:06:26,345
Tao.

92
00:06:37,585 --> 00:06:39,105
Actually, I'm unwell.

93
00:06:43,385 --> 00:06:44,625
I'm very sad.

94
00:06:46,345 --> 00:06:48,705
I've put in a lot of effort.
I tried to change.

95
00:06:50,265 --> 00:06:52,465
But no matter what I do,

96
00:06:53,385 --> 00:06:54,705
and how much effort I put into it,

97
00:06:56,985 --> 00:06:59,625
I couldn't achieve the result I wanted.

98
00:07:11,865 --> 00:07:15,465
I've put in 99% effort into it.

99
00:07:16,985 --> 00:07:18,545
Why can't I…

100
00:07:21,105 --> 00:07:24,065
get that final 1%

101
00:07:24,145 --> 00:07:26,025
luck?

102
00:07:30,665 --> 00:07:31,905
Don't cry.

103
00:07:39,025 --> 00:07:40,065
It's fine.

104
00:07:58,705 --> 00:08:00,425
Don't cry, all right?

105
00:08:02,425 --> 00:08:04,665
You will get that 1%.

106
00:09:19,065 --> 00:09:20,065
Sun Yu.

107
00:09:22,305 --> 00:09:24,345
Sun Yuanzhu's mother passed away.

108
00:09:29,385 --> 00:09:31,545
He is quite sad. Do you want to visit him?

109
00:09:35,025 --> 00:09:36,265
I'll come tomorrow.

110
00:09:38,145 --> 00:09:39,465
Let me send you the address.

111
00:09:39,545 --> 00:09:40,465
No need.

112
00:09:41,545 --> 00:09:42,985
I've been there many times.

113
00:09:44,265 --> 00:09:46,585
Throughout my whole life,

114
00:09:46,665 --> 00:09:49,785
I've only traveled a long way,
regardless of any obstacles,

115
00:09:50,705 --> 00:09:51,905
again and again for his sake.

116
00:09:55,385 --> 00:09:58,105
Just to have a meal with him

117
00:09:59,905 --> 00:10:00,825
and have a quick chat.

118
00:10:02,025 --> 00:10:03,025
Then,

119
00:10:03,825 --> 00:10:06,385
I'd take the early flight back
the next day.

120
00:10:07,585 --> 00:10:08,625
I'll be there tomorrow.

121
00:10:10,585 --> 00:10:11,425
Okay.

122
00:10:20,625 --> 00:10:25,545
BEIJING TO LANZHOU
FLIGHT TICKET PURCHASE WEBSITE

123
00:10:25,625 --> 00:10:28,465
SELECT PASSENGER: SUN YU

124
00:10:28,545 --> 00:10:30,345
TOTAL: RMB 734, PAY NOW

125
00:10:34,225 --> 00:10:35,545
PAYMENT SUCCESSFUL

126
00:11:00,945 --> 00:11:02,985
SHANG ZHITAO

127
00:11:12,745 --> 00:11:15,745
The number you are calling is busy.

128
00:11:31,025 --> 00:11:33,185
SHANG ZHITAO

129
00:11:38,585 --> 00:11:39,745
Hello?

130
00:11:40,745 --> 00:11:41,585
Luan Nian.

131
00:11:42,665 --> 00:11:43,745
Are you busy?

132
00:11:43,825 --> 00:11:44,665
Right.

133
00:11:45,465 --> 00:11:46,305
I was busy.

134
00:11:46,905 --> 00:11:48,625
Then, I'll video call you tomorrow.

135
00:11:49,305 --> 00:11:50,145
All right?

136
00:11:51,465 --> 00:11:52,705
I'm going to the US
the day after tomorrow.

137
00:11:53,425 --> 00:11:54,905
I'll leave Luke at the pet shop.

138
00:11:54,985 --> 00:11:56,585
I'm returning to Beijing next week.

139
00:11:57,305 --> 00:11:58,145
Okay.

140
00:11:59,985 --> 00:12:00,825
I'm hanging up.

141
00:12:36,705 --> 00:12:39,465
GROUP CHAT: WAS TRACY TALKING ABOUT YOU
AT THE MEETING?

142
00:12:39,545 --> 00:12:41,545
Is she going to be our future lady boss?

143
00:12:46,865 --> 00:12:49,745
In the future, we must be cautious
when we speak in front of Yilia and Luke.

144
00:12:50,825 --> 00:12:52,265
I also heard from our US colleagues

145
00:12:52,345 --> 00:12:54,025
that they go on
this business trip together.

146
00:12:54,105 --> 00:12:55,545
They also have meals together often.

147
00:12:57,225 --> 00:12:59,665
Yilia is a woman born in a rich family.

148
00:12:59,745 --> 00:13:01,105
She's a good match for Luke.

149
00:13:02,425 --> 00:13:05,345
I heard Yilia is the daughter of Mr. You,
our biggest client.

150
00:13:05,425 --> 00:13:07,145
Her father likes Luke a lot.

151
00:13:07,225 --> 00:13:09,345
He's going to allocate
next year's advertising budget to Lime.

152
00:13:21,865 --> 00:13:22,825
Tao.

153
00:13:22,905 --> 00:13:24,465
Lumi misses you so much.

154
00:13:27,865 --> 00:13:29,345
Shang Zhitao!

155
00:13:30,985 --> 00:13:32,385
You're finally back!

156
00:13:32,465 --> 00:13:34,185
I miss you so much.

157
00:13:34,265 --> 00:13:35,385
Are you staying for good this time?

158
00:13:36,065 --> 00:13:38,745
Next month. I'm coming back
for good next month.

159
00:13:39,785 --> 00:13:43,145
Do you know what kind of life

160
00:13:43,225 --> 00:13:44,145
I was living in Lime

161
00:13:44,225 --> 00:13:45,905
while you were assigned to work abroad?

162
00:13:47,105 --> 00:13:50,465
I've not met another coworker like you

163
00:13:50,545 --> 00:13:52,785
who is impressive,

164
00:13:52,865 --> 00:13:56,305
intelligent, and amazing after you left.

165
00:13:57,025 --> 00:13:58,305
Stop praising me.

166
00:13:58,385 --> 00:14:00,745
Without you, who's going to pamper me?

167
00:14:01,745 --> 00:14:02,825
Let me tell you.

168
00:14:02,905 --> 00:14:05,505
You'll soon be promoted
to specialist in Lime.

169
00:14:05,585 --> 00:14:07,465
You might be the one
pampering me in the future.

170
00:14:08,425 --> 00:14:10,545
I'm still preparing my work report.

171
00:14:10,625 --> 00:14:13,065
Let's wait
until the assessment result is out.

172
00:14:13,145 --> 00:14:15,585
I've gone through everything for you.

173
00:14:16,865 --> 00:14:18,105
The judges of the first round

174
00:14:18,185 --> 00:14:19,825
are the bosses of each division

175
00:14:19,905 --> 00:14:21,665
and two former specialists.

176
00:14:22,265 --> 00:14:23,945
Will is mine.

177
00:14:24,025 --> 00:14:26,785
If he dares give you a low score,
I'll not forgive him.

178
00:14:26,865 --> 00:14:29,665
Tracy has been treating you well, right?

179
00:14:29,745 --> 00:14:31,785
I don't have to say
anything more about Luke.

180
00:14:31,865 --> 00:14:33,345
He's fair, just, and open.

181
00:14:33,425 --> 00:14:36,385
So, your promotion to a specialist

182
00:14:36,465 --> 00:14:38,505
is set in stone.

183
00:14:40,345 --> 00:14:41,185
Is Will

184
00:14:42,265 --> 00:14:43,265
yours?

185
00:14:46,505 --> 00:14:48,185
Well, soon.

186
00:14:48,945 --> 00:14:51,505
Soon? I thought he was already yours.

187
00:14:51,585 --> 00:14:53,705
You're so bad. Are you teasing me?

188
00:14:53,785 --> 00:14:55,825
Of course not. I'll buy you coffee later.

189
00:14:55,905 --> 00:14:57,265
That's more like it.

190
00:14:58,385 --> 00:14:59,745
Luke is back. Do you know that?

191
00:15:01,745 --> 00:15:04,585
Isn't Luke staying in the US for a month?

192
00:15:05,545 --> 00:15:06,985
He came back early.

193
00:15:07,065 --> 00:15:08,425
Go and report to him

194
00:15:08,505 --> 00:15:09,945
when he is here later.

195
00:15:13,105 --> 00:15:14,945
Specialist.

196
00:15:22,825 --> 00:15:23,665
Luke.

197
00:15:34,905 --> 00:15:36,185
Come in.

198
00:15:40,945 --> 00:15:41,785
You're back.

199
00:15:44,385 --> 00:15:46,665
Why didn't you tell me beforehand?

200
00:15:47,865 --> 00:15:49,065
I made a last-minute change to my plans.

201
00:15:54,985 --> 00:15:55,865
What is it?

202
00:15:58,025 --> 00:15:58,865
No…

203
00:15:59,545 --> 00:16:02,065
It's nothing.
I just came to report to you.

204
00:16:06,985 --> 00:16:07,825
Sure.

205
00:17:00,745 --> 00:17:01,705
Why are you still here?

206
00:17:03,665 --> 00:17:04,785
I'm waiting for you.

207
00:17:21,665 --> 00:17:22,585
What's wrong?

208
00:17:22,665 --> 00:17:24,385
Something bad happened
when you were in the US?

209
00:17:27,065 --> 00:17:28,025
Everything was normal.

210
00:17:29,985 --> 00:17:31,345
We've not seen each other for two months.

211
00:17:31,425 --> 00:17:32,585
Don't you miss me?

212
00:17:32,665 --> 00:17:33,665
I missed you a lot.

213
00:17:35,305 --> 00:17:36,145
Is that so?

214
00:17:38,225 --> 00:17:39,105
I didn't.

215
00:17:43,505 --> 00:17:44,345
What's wrong?

216
00:17:45,785 --> 00:17:46,945
Did I offend you somehow?

217
00:17:47,025 --> 00:17:47,985
You're scaring me.

218
00:17:49,985 --> 00:17:51,265
Me? Scaring you? No way.

219
00:17:52,545 --> 00:17:54,465
You insisted on staying
in Northwestern China.

220
00:17:54,545 --> 00:17:55,465
You said you liked it there.

221
00:17:55,545 --> 00:17:57,105
What's the point of missing you?

222
00:17:57,665 --> 00:17:58,945
I can't transfer you back either.

223
00:17:59,945 --> 00:18:01,985
You have your own definition of success

224
00:18:02,065 --> 00:18:03,745
and your own way of living.
I respect that.

225
00:18:03,825 --> 00:18:05,105
I have no right to interfere.

226
00:18:05,185 --> 00:18:06,745
You have the right
to choose your own life.

227
00:18:06,825 --> 00:18:07,705
No problem.

228
00:18:10,425 --> 00:18:12,465
Can we talk nicely?

229
00:18:12,545 --> 00:18:13,785
What are you trying to say here?

230
00:18:14,705 --> 00:18:15,545
What am I trying to say?

231
00:18:16,665 --> 00:18:18,785
My girlfriend was talking

232
00:18:18,865 --> 00:18:20,505
with another man downstairs

233
00:18:20,585 --> 00:18:21,625
while crying and hugging him
the whole night.

234
00:18:26,505 --> 00:18:27,585
What do you mean?

235
00:18:28,105 --> 00:18:29,665
What do you mean by

236
00:18:30,505 --> 00:18:31,865
hugging and crying with someone else?

237
00:18:34,305 --> 00:18:35,825
Shang Zhitao, you're quite something.

238
00:18:36,745 --> 00:18:38,305
You keep saying you miss me,

239
00:18:38,385 --> 00:18:40,025
but you keep looking for your next one.

240
00:18:40,105 --> 00:18:42,945
Do you think you are so charming
that you can start fooling around

241
00:18:43,025 --> 00:18:44,425
-with different men?
-Luan Nian.

242
00:18:45,785 --> 00:18:47,225
You can choose not to trust me,

243
00:18:47,305 --> 00:18:48,985
but you cannot accuse me
of something I never did.

244
00:19:00,145 --> 00:19:01,145
Did I confront you about this?

245
00:19:01,825 --> 00:19:03,345
Did I confront you
when you dined with another woman?

246
00:19:03,425 --> 00:19:04,625
I didn't, right?

247
00:19:04,705 --> 00:19:05,625
Did I confront you

248
00:19:05,705 --> 00:19:07,225
about why the company
is full of rumors about you two?

249
00:19:07,305 --> 00:19:09,745
I didn't, right? Because I trust you.

250
00:19:09,825 --> 00:19:12,345
I've always thought that
we knew each other well

251
00:19:12,425 --> 00:19:14,145
in terms of our social circle.

252
00:19:14,225 --> 00:19:16,265
However, you are pinning
such a big accusation on me

253
00:19:16,345 --> 00:19:18,065
because I went to comfort my friend.

254
00:19:18,145 --> 00:19:19,505
Should we just avoid any interactions

255
00:19:19,585 --> 00:19:21,585
with the other gender
because we are together?

256
00:19:21,665 --> 00:19:24,345
No need. I didn't avoid it.

257
00:19:25,705 --> 00:19:27,745
I can also get along well

258
00:19:27,825 --> 00:19:30,345
with women whom I admire
and work well with me.

259
00:19:30,425 --> 00:19:31,265
Even if I get off work,

260
00:19:31,345 --> 00:19:32,625
I don't think
having a meal or having a chat

261
00:19:32,705 --> 00:19:34,265
is a waste of time.

262
00:19:34,345 --> 00:19:35,225
I know.

263
00:19:35,305 --> 00:19:37,425
I know you can admire

264
00:19:37,505 --> 00:19:39,265
someone you admire openly.

265
00:19:39,345 --> 00:19:41,545
I've never felt jealous about it.
It's true.

266
00:19:42,585 --> 00:19:44,705
So, Luan Nian, please view

267
00:19:44,785 --> 00:19:47,705
my relationship
with Sun Yuanzhu rationally.

268
00:19:47,785 --> 00:19:49,665
After all, during a few difficult moments
in my life,

269
00:19:49,745 --> 00:19:51,065
it was him,

270
00:19:51,145 --> 00:19:52,385
Lumi, and Sun Yu who kept me company.

271
00:19:54,425 --> 00:19:57,025
Luan Nian, I want you to know
that no matter how much I love you,

272
00:19:57,105 --> 00:19:59,185
I'd never give up my friends.

273
00:20:00,025 --> 00:20:02,065
I also won't interfere with you
working with Song Ying.

274
00:20:08,465 --> 00:20:10,425
That's a fair exchange.

275
00:20:11,105 --> 00:20:12,505
I hope you remember and stick to it.

276
00:22:13,225 --> 00:22:14,945
Were you at Northwestern China that day?

277
00:22:18,985 --> 00:22:21,065
How come you knew Sun Yuanzhu cried?

278
00:22:26,865 --> 00:22:30,265
I would like to know
why you came that day.

279
00:22:30,945 --> 00:22:32,345
I would like to know why you cried.

280
00:22:39,265 --> 00:22:41,185
Sun Yuanzhu's family member passed away.

281
00:22:42,025 --> 00:22:43,345
He was sad.

282
00:22:45,025 --> 00:22:46,305
He seemed off emotionally.

283
00:22:46,865 --> 00:22:49,145
I figured he was ill. He couldn't eat.

284
00:22:50,465 --> 00:22:52,505
I cried because I felt bad.

285
00:22:56,265 --> 00:23:00,065
Luan Nian. He is
a really good friend of mine.

286
00:23:00,145 --> 00:23:02,785
Can you not get the wrong idea about him
and about our friendship?

287
00:23:09,105 --> 00:23:09,985
I'll try my best.

288
00:23:13,505 --> 00:23:14,905
So, you were there that day.

289
00:23:15,945 --> 00:23:16,985
Why?

290
00:23:21,945 --> 00:23:23,505
Because I suddenly missed you.

291
00:23:44,705 --> 00:23:47,145
TIANTONG YUAN STATION TIMETABLE

292
00:23:54,865 --> 00:23:56,185
REDEFINING THE ROLE OF THE ACCOUNT MANAGER
FROM EXECUTION TO SOLUTIONS

293
00:23:56,265 --> 00:23:58,185
2016-2017: METHODOLOGY CONSOLIDATION
AND STRATEGIC ELEVATION

294
00:24:01,985 --> 00:24:03,305
WORK PERFORMANCE REPORT

295
00:24:12,025 --> 00:24:13,425
1. BRING PARENTS TO TRAVEL
2. LEARN ENGLISH 3. LEARN HOW TO DRIVE

296
00:24:13,505 --> 00:24:14,625
4. LEARN FRENCH 5. GO TO TIBET
6. TRAVEL ABROAD

297
00:24:14,705 --> 00:24:16,105
7. READ 200 BOOKS
8. MAKE THREE FRIENDS AND ABOVE

298
00:24:16,185 --> 00:24:17,585
9. MARRY THE PERSON I LOVE
10. BECOME A LIME SPECIALIST

299
00:24:22,185 --> 00:24:23,025
Flora.

300
00:24:23,105 --> 00:24:25,505
If you are ready, let's begin.

301
00:24:29,905 --> 00:24:32,025
I joined Lime in 2012.

302
00:24:33,065 --> 00:24:34,385
My first lesson about work

303
00:24:34,465 --> 00:24:36,425
was from my interview with my boss.

304
00:24:37,305 --> 00:24:39,305
I had to shed my student's mindset,

305
00:24:39,385 --> 00:24:42,185
get my superior's attention,
and manage upward.

306
00:24:43,225 --> 00:24:45,785
Time is precious for everyone at work,

307
00:24:46,585 --> 00:24:47,745
including mine.

308
00:24:47,825 --> 00:24:48,905
Are you done?

309
00:24:49,545 --> 00:24:51,065
I thought your time was worthless,

310
00:24:51,145 --> 00:24:52,505
so I can put off your task.

311
00:24:56,025 --> 00:24:57,145
I understand.

312
00:24:57,225 --> 00:24:59,825
In the future,
I'll make my request directly.

313
00:24:59,905 --> 00:25:01,185
Thank you for your guidance.

314
00:25:01,265 --> 00:25:04,465
My first project at Lime
was an e-commerce advertisement.

315
00:25:04,545 --> 00:25:06,385
This project taught me

316
00:25:06,465 --> 00:25:08,545
to be clear about the scope
of my responsibilities.

317
00:25:09,265 --> 00:25:11,545
Due to a messy report given to the client,

318
00:25:11,625 --> 00:25:13,585
I was scolded by my superior
and felt aggrieved.

319
00:25:13,665 --> 00:25:14,985
Now, I get it.

320
00:25:15,065 --> 00:25:16,905
Being a professional
is not about completing the task,

321
00:25:17,705 --> 00:25:18,705
but completing it correctly.

322
00:25:21,545 --> 00:25:23,665
In my third year in Lime,

323
00:25:23,745 --> 00:25:25,985
I started digging deeply
into industry data

324
00:25:26,585 --> 00:25:29,305
and analyzing
the company's past case reports.

325
00:25:29,385 --> 00:25:31,345
I stepped into our clients' shoes
to think about what they need,

326
00:25:31,425 --> 00:25:33,585
what they care about,
what I can provide to them,

327
00:25:33,665 --> 00:25:34,825
and my individual strength.

328
00:25:36,385 --> 00:25:38,585
Until I completed an S-class project

329
00:25:38,665 --> 00:25:39,905
on my own,

330
00:25:41,425 --> 00:25:43,465
I finally understood

331
00:25:43,545 --> 00:25:47,105
the meaning of being an account manager.

332
00:25:55,465 --> 00:25:56,985
Until now,

333
00:25:57,065 --> 00:25:59,185
I still remember the time I first met you.

334
00:26:00,465 --> 00:26:01,745
It has been six years now.

335
00:26:01,825 --> 00:26:03,585
Time passes so quickly.

336
00:26:03,665 --> 00:26:06,625
Before the other two judges
ask you questions,

337
00:26:06,705 --> 00:26:08,305
I'd like to thank you

338
00:26:08,385 --> 00:26:10,065
for your contribution
over the last six years

339
00:26:10,145 --> 00:26:11,745
on behalf of the company.

340
00:26:12,585 --> 00:26:14,065
Thank you, Flora.

341
00:26:40,105 --> 00:26:41,065
How was it?

342
00:26:44,185 --> 00:26:45,425
I did my best.

343
00:26:46,305 --> 00:26:47,505
When will the result be out?

344
00:26:48,185 --> 00:26:49,625
Probably during the annual meeting.

345
00:26:50,585 --> 00:26:52,745
Then, let me congratulate you

346
00:26:52,825 --> 00:26:55,425
on becoming a Lime Specialist in advance.

347
00:26:57,185 --> 00:26:59,305
Let's pick up Yuanzhu later,
and we'll go grocery shopping.

348
00:26:59,385 --> 00:27:01,025
I must tell Zhu

349
00:27:01,105 --> 00:27:02,665
that I completed the work report

350
00:27:02,745 --> 00:27:04,785
using the method he taught me.

351
00:27:04,865 --> 00:27:07,585
I must thank him well.

352
00:27:09,665 --> 00:27:11,625
His residential study ends today.

353
00:27:12,625 --> 00:27:14,785
I previously coaxed him

354
00:27:14,865 --> 00:27:16,825
into doing a check-up
with me at the hospital.

355
00:27:17,465 --> 00:27:18,825
He does have depression.

356
00:27:20,145 --> 00:27:22,105
However, he is willing to accept treatment

357
00:27:22,185 --> 00:27:24,265
and take medications.

358
00:27:24,345 --> 00:27:26,145
The treatment is quite effective.

359
00:27:27,465 --> 00:27:28,785
He has been eating well,

360
00:27:28,865 --> 00:27:29,825
and he started smiling.

361
00:27:29,905 --> 00:27:31,225
He loves to talk too.

362
00:27:31,825 --> 00:27:33,545
A few days ago,
I took him to watch a movie at night.

363
00:27:33,625 --> 00:27:35,425
He was having fun.

364
00:27:35,505 --> 00:27:37,985
He was so happy
that I didn't know what to say.

365
00:27:38,865 --> 00:27:40,065
When I saw him smiling,

366
00:27:40,985 --> 00:27:42,305
I felt happy too.

367
00:27:44,905 --> 00:27:46,025
Me too.

368
00:27:47,105 --> 00:27:48,825
When I see both of you happy,

369
00:27:49,745 --> 00:27:51,025
I feel happy too.

370
00:27:53,025 --> 00:27:54,505
Our lives

371
00:27:55,265 --> 00:27:57,345
will surely get better.

372
00:27:58,905 --> 00:27:59,905
Yes.

373
00:28:05,505 --> 00:28:06,345
Look.

374
00:28:07,865 --> 00:28:08,905
It's so pretty.

375
00:28:10,545 --> 00:28:11,385
Hurry.

376
00:28:11,465 --> 00:28:12,785
Take a picture with your phone.

377
00:28:12,865 --> 00:28:14,465
Send it to Yuanzhu.

378
00:28:14,545 --> 00:28:15,785
Tell him to wait for us.

379
00:28:41,785 --> 00:28:43,785
Why isn't he picking up?

380
00:28:43,865 --> 00:28:44,945
He's not picking up?

381
00:28:45,025 --> 00:28:46,105
-Let me call him.
-He didn't reply to my text either.

382
00:28:46,185 --> 00:28:47,065
Call him.

383
00:28:47,145 --> 00:28:48,945
THE CROWNING MASTERPIECE
ON CHANG'AN AVENUE

384
00:28:49,025 --> 00:28:50,025
Are you calling him?

385
00:28:50,105 --> 00:28:50,985
Yes. He's not answering.

386
00:28:51,065 --> 00:28:52,345
He didn't answer?

387
00:28:53,025 --> 00:28:54,705
Is he working overtime without telling me?

388
00:28:54,785 --> 00:28:57,025
I don't think so.
He would have told us beforehand.

389
00:28:58,145 --> 00:28:59,905
Let me send him another text.

390
00:29:00,585 --> 00:29:03,225
A colleague of mine committed suicide.

391
00:29:04,785 --> 00:29:05,665
It just happened.

392
00:29:09,385 --> 00:29:10,465
He was fine.

393
00:29:10,545 --> 00:29:11,985
Why did he commit suicide?

394
00:29:12,065 --> 00:29:13,225
‎What's so hard for him to get over?

395
00:29:17,985 --> 00:29:19,025
This place, right?

396
00:29:19,545 --> 00:29:21,345
It was split open. His head was…

397
00:29:21,425 --> 00:29:22,705
I heard he was developing
self-driving cars.

398
00:29:22,785 --> 00:29:24,865
-He jumped down from upstairs.
-That floor.

399
00:29:24,945 --> 00:29:25,905
From upstairs.

400
00:29:25,985 --> 00:29:28,225
-It's so tall.
-I wonder what happened to him.

401
00:29:28,305 --> 00:29:29,625
I heard the fall was really bad.

402
00:29:29,705 --> 00:29:31,905
Captain, the victim's phone is ringing.

403
00:29:35,465 --> 00:29:36,345
Hello?

404
00:29:37,305 --> 00:29:38,225
Are you the victim's family member?

405
00:30:17,745 --> 00:30:20,625
Officer. Who is this?

406
00:30:20,705 --> 00:30:22,625
An employee of this building.
I can't disclose anything else.

407
00:30:23,345 --> 00:30:24,385
An employee?

408
00:30:39,145 --> 00:30:40,905
I really want to jump into the clouds.

409
00:30:43,825 --> 00:30:45,625
Actually, I'm unwell.

410
00:30:45,705 --> 00:30:47,105
I'm very sad.

411
00:30:47,185 --> 00:30:50,585
But no matter what I did,
and how much effort I put into it,

412
00:30:51,585 --> 00:30:54,105
I couldn't achieve the result I wanted.

413
00:30:55,465 --> 00:30:58,905
I've put in 99% effort into it.

414
00:30:59,945 --> 00:31:02,825
Why can't I get that final 1%

415
00:31:02,905 --> 00:31:04,705
luck?

416
00:31:29,865 --> 00:31:30,745
No.

417
00:31:32,265 --> 00:31:33,345
It's not him, right?

418
00:31:52,625 --> 00:31:53,825
No.

419
00:31:53,905 --> 00:31:55,305
It's not real, Tao.

420
00:32:18,465 --> 00:32:19,345
Everyone, don't gather here.

421
00:32:19,425 --> 00:32:20,745
Disperse. Move along.

422
00:32:20,825 --> 00:32:21,665
Take care of the body first.

423
00:32:21,745 --> 00:32:23,105
Contact the coroner
and his family members.

424
00:32:32,105 --> 00:32:34,665
EMERGENCY RESCUE

425
00:34:38,145 --> 00:34:39,065
You must be hungry.

426
00:34:55,425 --> 00:34:56,945
I am Sun Yuanzhu.

427
00:34:57,025 --> 00:34:57,865
WELCOME HOME

428
00:34:57,945 --> 00:34:59,585
Does your name mean

429
00:34:59,665 --> 00:35:00,785
"With fierce ambition
that reaches beyond the four seas,

430
00:35:00,865 --> 00:35:02,465
I spread my wings
and long to soar to distant horizons?"

431
00:35:03,785 --> 00:35:05,625
I bought many ingredients today.

432
00:35:05,705 --> 00:35:06,705
It's so heavy.

433
00:35:07,305 --> 00:35:08,745
I also bought flour.

434
00:35:08,825 --> 00:35:10,545
Let me make handmade noodles
for all of you later.

435
00:35:12,465 --> 00:35:15,305
I want to get a longer dining table

436
00:35:15,385 --> 00:35:18,185
so everyone can sit and work together.

437
00:35:18,265 --> 00:35:20,825
Then, I want to rearrange the living room.

438
00:35:20,905 --> 00:35:22,745
The sofa and bookshelves are new.

439
00:35:25,225 --> 00:35:27,385
This is Luke's home now.

440
00:36:04,825 --> 00:36:07,505
Tomato and egg noodles without tomatoes

441
00:36:07,585 --> 00:36:09,225
have no souls.

442
00:36:09,945 --> 00:36:11,505
Have a spoonful.

443
00:36:11,585 --> 00:36:13,265
Have two spoonfuls.

444
00:36:15,225 --> 00:36:16,425
Add this yourself.

445
00:36:17,505 --> 00:36:19,185
-Try it.
-You too.

446
00:36:19,265 --> 00:36:20,345
Try it first.

447
00:36:29,065 --> 00:36:30,065
Delicious.

448
00:36:31,665 --> 00:36:32,505
Have another spoonful.

449
00:36:42,465 --> 00:36:43,505
Sun Yu.

450
00:36:44,545 --> 00:36:45,825
Sun Yu, stop.

451
00:36:57,065 --> 00:36:58,705
It tastes like Yuanzhu's cooking.

452
00:38:16,705 --> 00:38:20,705
THOUGHTS FROM THE CUTE YUANZHU

453
00:38:26,465 --> 00:38:28,985
THOUGHTS FROM THE CUTE YUANZHU

454
00:38:31,305 --> 00:38:32,265
I'm going to be late.

455
00:38:32,345 --> 00:38:34,305
Don't need to send me off. I can go alone.

456
00:38:52,425 --> 00:38:53,505
Will we…

457
00:38:56,225 --> 00:38:58,385
have a bright future ahead of us?

458
00:39:03,185 --> 00:39:05,025
Will I ever get to see the future

459
00:39:05,625 --> 00:39:06,505
where we

460
00:39:07,305 --> 00:39:08,345
love each other

461
00:39:09,425 --> 00:39:13,425
and spend many years
walking through life together?

462
00:39:29,745 --> 00:39:30,585
Sorry.

463
00:39:59,745 --> 00:40:00,705
Sun Yu.

464
00:40:02,585 --> 00:40:04,985
I will watch you fall in love,

465
00:40:05,545 --> 00:40:07,265
get married, have kids,

466
00:40:08,665 --> 00:40:09,985
be happy forever,

467
00:40:10,985 --> 00:40:12,185
and never suffer from beyond the world.

468
00:41:01,825 --> 00:41:03,505
SUN YU: I WILL WATCH YOU FALL IN LOVE
GET MARRIED, HAVE KIDS

469
00:41:03,585 --> 00:41:05,425
BE HAPPY FOREVER
AND NEVER SUFFER FROM BEYOND THE WORLD

470
00:41:16,545 --> 00:41:17,705
Sun Yuanzhu,

471
00:41:19,465 --> 00:41:21,065
I hope I can meet you

472
00:41:22,065 --> 00:41:24,105
when I'm 17 years old in my next life.

473
00:41:25,225 --> 00:41:27,265
I want to give all my love

474
00:41:28,625 --> 00:41:29,505
to you.

475
00:41:30,625 --> 00:41:31,945
From when I'm young

476
00:41:32,865 --> 00:41:33,905
until I grow old,

477
00:41:35,785 --> 00:41:36,625
I hope

478
00:41:37,425 --> 00:41:39,905
all the "I love yous" I told you

479
00:41:41,985 --> 00:41:44,225
will become the lights on your journey

480
00:41:45,425 --> 00:41:47,265
that illuminate your path
to the afterlife.

481
00:41:50,105 --> 00:41:51,185
I hope

482
00:41:52,545 --> 00:41:53,625
you no longer suffer.

483
00:42:15,425 --> 00:42:16,265
Come in.

484
00:42:17,505 --> 00:42:18,385
Do you want some water?

485
00:42:29,945 --> 00:42:31,385
Yuanzhu's diary.

486
00:42:32,425 --> 00:42:34,825
Keep it. It's a keepsake.

487
00:42:35,825 --> 00:42:36,825
Read it first.

488
00:42:37,385 --> 00:42:38,345
He mentioned you.

489
00:42:52,745 --> 00:42:53,905
Her name is Shang Zhitao.

490
00:42:54,705 --> 00:42:56,105
Like the flourishing peach tree

491
00:42:56,185 --> 00:42:57,265
with its brilliant blossoms,

492
00:42:57,985 --> 00:42:59,025
the name perfectly suits her.

493
00:42:59,945 --> 00:43:01,505
Her bright smile

494
00:43:02,225 --> 00:43:03,825
can light up the whole world.

495
00:43:06,585 --> 00:43:07,945
Tao said

496
00:43:08,025 --> 00:43:10,105
she wanted to receive roses.

497
00:43:10,185 --> 00:43:11,145
Sun Yu,

498
00:43:12,065 --> 00:43:13,585
can you give me a bouquet of flowers?

499
00:43:18,985 --> 00:43:20,425
I gave her flowers for a few days,

500
00:43:20,505 --> 00:43:21,865
and I saw how happy she was.

501
00:43:22,865 --> 00:43:24,785
I hope she can be this happy forever.

502
00:43:29,505 --> 00:43:32,705
Tao wrote these words
on the postcard she sent me from Phuket.

503
00:43:33,465 --> 00:43:35,425
I hope smiles are the only thing

504
00:43:35,505 --> 00:43:36,665
you see in your eyes.

505
00:43:36,745 --> 00:43:38,465
TO SUN YUANZHU
MAY YOUR EYES SEE ONLY SMILES

506
00:43:43,665 --> 00:43:46,185
I want to tell her that I hope

507
00:43:47,305 --> 00:43:48,985
every dream she has

508
00:43:49,785 --> 00:43:51,105
won't be an empty dream.

509
00:43:55,465 --> 00:43:58,505
She is like a shining star.

510
00:43:59,025 --> 00:44:01,545
Pure, wonderful,

511
00:44:04,425 --> 00:44:05,785
and out of reach.

512
00:44:08,625 --> 00:44:10,305
I'm like the fox

513
00:44:10,945 --> 00:44:12,545
who watches over her.

514
00:44:13,705 --> 00:44:15,585
I can only look at her from afar

515
00:44:16,625 --> 00:44:17,665
without approaching her.

516
00:44:19,745 --> 00:44:21,105
I can't have her.

517
00:44:21,625 --> 00:44:23,865
I hope Tao will never know about this.

518
00:44:24,545 --> 00:44:25,385
I hope…

519
00:44:25,465 --> 00:44:26,905
I HOPE SHE CAN BE HAPPY FOREVER

520
00:44:26,985 --> 00:44:28,105
…she can do whatever she wants.

521
00:44:28,185 --> 00:44:32,305
I HOPE SHE CAN DO WHATEVER SHE WANTS

522
00:44:32,385 --> 00:44:34,225
Sometimes, staying away

523
00:44:35,585 --> 00:44:37,105
is also a kind of love.

524
00:44:38,385 --> 00:44:40,785
People were born to be free,

525
00:44:40,865 --> 00:44:43,225
but they are always bound by shackles.

526
00:44:43,825 --> 00:44:46,385
Tao doesn't seem happy
in her relationship.

527
00:44:46,465 --> 00:44:48,065
Perhaps

528
00:44:48,145 --> 00:44:50,505
every relationship is just a hierarchy

529
00:44:51,905 --> 00:44:53,785
until you can stand
on equal footing with one another.

530
00:44:55,265 --> 00:44:56,865
I blame myself.

531
00:44:57,905 --> 00:45:00,505
If I had worked harder
and not had so much burden,

532
00:45:02,025 --> 00:45:04,345
could I bring her happiness?

533
00:45:07,825 --> 00:45:09,465
But perhaps being happy is difficult.

534
00:45:11,345 --> 00:45:12,785
I haven't learned it myself.

535
00:45:14,985 --> 00:45:17,265
April is the most miserable month.

536
00:45:18,665 --> 00:45:19,865
Only faded memories remain

537
00:45:21,265 --> 00:45:23,025
on this barren wasteland.

538
00:45:24,185 --> 00:45:25,865
I'm someone who's empty inside,

539
00:45:26,825 --> 00:45:28,665
wandering in the void.

540
00:45:30,025 --> 00:45:31,305
My heart

541
00:45:32,465 --> 00:45:34,105
has also turned into an empty wasteland.

542
00:45:35,545 --> 00:45:36,465
Mom…

543
00:45:40,825 --> 00:45:41,705
passed away.

544
00:45:44,785 --> 00:45:47,225
I yearn for the rain.
I yearn to be nourished.

545
00:45:47,305 --> 00:45:48,225
I yearn…

546
00:45:51,465 --> 00:45:52,505
to be reborn.

547
00:45:54,905 --> 00:45:55,985
But…

548
00:45:58,505 --> 00:45:59,905
is there still hope?

549
00:46:05,105 --> 00:46:09,905
THAT LIGHT, IT SEEMS UNREACHABLE

550
00:46:10,745 --> 00:46:11,625
Farewell,

551
00:46:13,025 --> 00:46:14,465
the world I loved

552
00:46:16,585 --> 00:46:17,705
and the people I loved.

553
00:46:18,905 --> 00:46:19,985
Let's not see each other again.

554
00:46:37,905 --> 00:46:39,145
So you've always known.

555
00:46:44,825 --> 00:46:45,665
Sun Yu.

556
00:46:55,465 --> 00:46:56,505
I'm so sorry.

557
00:46:58,305 --> 00:46:59,505
Don't be.

558
00:47:00,985 --> 00:47:02,185
I was just

559
00:47:03,745 --> 00:47:04,585
loving him

560
00:47:06,025 --> 00:47:07,185
purely.

561
00:47:08,425 --> 00:47:09,785
It doesn't matter who he liked.

562
00:47:17,425 --> 00:47:19,305
Throughout my long years,

563
00:47:21,425 --> 00:47:24,505
he has given me countless moments
of warmth and kindness.

564
00:47:30,985 --> 00:47:33,185
I, Sun Yu, fell in love with an angel.

565
00:47:40,265 --> 00:47:41,105
He

566
00:47:42,665 --> 00:47:44,305
was an angel.

567
00:47:57,625 --> 00:47:59,425
Why are you crying?

568
00:48:39,465 --> 00:48:41,225
I still remember the time

569
00:48:41,305 --> 00:48:42,745
I first met you.

570
00:48:43,985 --> 00:48:45,345
It has been six years now.

571
00:48:45,425 --> 00:48:46,785
Time passes so quickly.

